<section class="check-understanding" id="sect-00003"><exercise id="_414a4c79-f8ca-4d84-bdb0-3799b2d22150" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00008"><para id="para-00029">Enter your answer here:</para><para id="para-00030"> When \(x=-3\) and \(x^2=9\), what is value of \(x^2-3\)?</para>
      </problem><solution id="sol-00008"><para id="para-00031">Correct! \((-3)^2-3=9-3=6\)</para><para id="para-00032">The correct answer is 6. \((-3)^2-3=9-3=6\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="f903c1c9-b5cf-482c-a4ca-22c9fa11ad99" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00009"><para id="para-00033">Enter your answer here:</para><para id="para-00034"> When \(x=-2\) and \(x^2=4\), what is value of \(x^2-3\)?</para>
      </problem><solution id="sol-00009"><para id="para-00035">Correct! \((-2)^2-3=4-3=1\)</para><para id="para-00036">The correct answer is 1. \((-2)^2-3=4-3=1\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_9da988cd-6c24-4c40-b6ec-1f4ee1a64054" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00010"><para id="para-00037">Enter your answer here:</para><para id="para-00038"> When \(x=-1\) and \(x^2=1\), what is value of \(x^2-3\)? </para>
      </problem><solution id="sol-00010"><para id="para-00039">Correct! \((-1)^2-3=1-3=-2\)</para><para id="para-00040">The correct answer is -2. \((-1)^2-3=1-3=-2\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="e7496405-bc12-4bc9-adcf-b73b9aec4f83" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00011"><para id="para-00041">Enter your answer here:</para><para id="para-00042"> When \(x=0\) and \(x^2=0\), what is value of \(x^2-3\)?</para>
      </problem><solution id="sol-00011"><para id="para-00043">Correct! \((0)^2-3=0-3=-3\)</para><para id="para-00044">The correct answer is -3. \((0)^2-3=0-3=-3\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="a09868fb-17d3-46d0-b856-6287faee4786" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00012"><para id="para-00045">Enter your answer here:</para><para id="para-00046"> When \(x=1\) and \(x^2=1\), what is value of \(x^2-3\)?</para>
      </problem><solution id="sol-00012"><para id="para-00047">Correct! \(-2. (1)2-3=1-3=-2\)</para><para id="para-00048">The correct answer is -2. \(-2. (1)2-3=1-3=-2\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_29189482-f312-4e41-9f3b-fbf3c52bb5ef" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00013"><para id="para-00049">Enter your answer here:</para><para id="para-00050"> When \(x=2\) and \(x^2=4\), what is value of \(x^2-3\)? </para>
      </problem><solution id="sol-00013"><para id="para-00051">Correct! \((2)^2-3=4-3=1\)</para><para id="para-00052">The correct answer is 1. \((2)^2-3=4-3=1\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_36a5a0df-8eed-4890-974e-47533bc33e7c" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00014"><para id="para-00053">Enter your answer here:</para><para id="para-00054"> When \(x=3\) and \(x^2=9\), what is value of \(x^2+10\)?</para>
      </problem><solution id="sol-00014"><para id="para-00055">Correct! \((3)^2-3=9-3=6\)</para><para id="para-00056">The correct answer is 6. \((3)^2-3=9-3=6\)</para></solution></exercise></section>
